Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:57:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Harden Discord OAuth loopback callback against foreign
 requests

Require a same-origin Origin header on the fragment POST, cap the body at
16 KiB with a read timeout, serve the bridge page for every GET, and
ignore callbacks with a wrong state instead of aborting the sign-in.
Previously any web page or local process could abort the login with one
POST or exhaust memory with an unbounded body.

